{"id":"a5ef915ed4ef0f09","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-subformula-property.md","title":"Subformula Property","display":"Subformula Property","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-subformula-property","aliases":["93-lem-subformula-property"],"display":"Subformula Property","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-subformula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-subformula-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-subformula-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Subformula Property"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19a3080f0dd154a2\" href=\"?note=19a3080f0dd154a2\" title=\"93-df-subformula\">93-df-subformula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-subformula-property---Subformula-Property\">lem-subformula-property - Subformula Property</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi,\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\psi,\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(-,-;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(-,-;\\tau)\\)</span> is the relation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"19a3080f0dd154a2\" href=\"?note=19a3080f0dd154a2\" title=\"93-df-subformula\">93-df-subformula</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(-;\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(-;\\tau)\\)</span> is the type-indexed variable-support map of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi;\\tau)\\to\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\psi;\\tau)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi;\\tau)\\to\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\psi;\\tau)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Every variable in a subformula already occurs in the containing formula.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-subformula-property---Subformula-Property","text":"lem-subformula-property - Subformula Property","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"19a3080f0dd154a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"19a3080f0dd154a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\psi,\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)$ and $\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(-,-;\\tau)$ is the relation of [[93-df-subformula]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(-;\\tau)$ is the type-indexed variable-support map of [[93-df-formula]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\psi,\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(-,-;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(-;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subform}_{93}(\\psi,\\varphi;\\tau)\\to\n\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\psi;\\tau)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{VarSupp}_{93}(\\varphi;\\tau).","display":true}],"bytes":848,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["c2ca1af9af149e69","19a3080f0dd154a2"]}